with your trusty flares or soon you'll find yourself without a job o\u0337\u0306\u0321r\u0335\u035d\u0326 \u0338\u033e\u035ay\u0338\u0311\u033co\u0336\u034b\u0325u\u0337\u0346\u031er\u0336\u0303\u0330 \u0337\u0304\u0328l\u0338\u030a\u0320i\u0334\u035d\u032ff\u0338\u0340\u0323e\u0338\u0342\u035a !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255540/extras/fedb4256ee7d7150a6e986b659bba59d.poster.avif?t=1746250642\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255540/extras/fedb4256ee7d7150a6e986b659bba59d.webm?t=1746250642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255540/extras/fedb4256ee7d7150a6e986b659bba59d.mp4?t=1746250642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
